# Database migrations

Schema changes are managed with Alembic. SQLite is used for the single-user app.

```sh
make migrate                        # apply pending migrations
make migration m="add table"        # autogenerate a revision
make downgrade                      # roll back one revision
```

Migrations run with `render_as_batch=True` so SQLite table alterations work.
Review every autogenerated revision before committing it, especially check
constraints and partial indexes.
